Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:42.60,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:50.70,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:55.76,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:02:00.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:06.21,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:13.74,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:16.99,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:20.91,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.77,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.89,0:02:29.50,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:35.50,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:39.60,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.79,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:45.32,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don’t want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:48.56,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I’m just here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:52.13,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Beware
